        android:fillColor="#FFFFFFFF"
        android:pathData="M42,50 a8,8 0 1,0 16,0 a8,8 0 1,0 -16,0 Z M64.8,38 a5.2,5.2 0 1,0 10.4,0 a5.2,5.2 0 1,0 -10.4,0 Z M80.5,57 a4.5,4.5 0 1,0 9,0 a4.5,4.5 0 1,0 -9,0 Z M33.3,13 a6.7,6.7 0 1,0 13.4,0 a6.7,6.7 0 1,0 -13.4,0 Z M64.2,62 a5.8,5.8 0 1,0 11.6,0 a5.8,5.8 0 1,0 -11.6,0 Z M45.7,72 a4.3,4.3 0 1,0 8.6,0 a4.3,4.3 0 1,0 -8.6,0 Z M21.5,83 a3.5,3.5 0 1,0 7,0 a3.5,3.5 0 1,0 -7,0 Z M12.2,57 a2.8,2.8 0 1,0 5.6,0 a2.8,2.8 0 1,0 -5.6,0 Z M16.5,38 a3.5,3.5 0 1,0 7,0 a3.5,3.5 0 1,0 -7,0 Z" />
    <path
